  "id": "specific-learning-disability",
  "term": "specific learning disability",
  "definition": "A specific learning disability is a difficulty in acquiring a particular academic skill despite otherwise normal general intelligence. In this packet, the example given is developmental dyscalculia, which affects the learning of mathematical skills.",
